#. Short description.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Do you play Singles or Doubles Tournaments? This plugin manages Rotation Tournaments where players have a different partner in each game."
msgstr "Spielst du Einzel- oder Doppelturniere? Dieses Plugin verwaltet Rotationsturniere, bei denen die Spieler in jedem Spiel einen anderen Partner haben."

#. Plugin name.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Rotation Tournaments"
msgstr "Rotationsturniere"

#. Found in installation paragraph.
